{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Seed Audio 1.5 分轨接口",
    "description": "Seed Audio 1.5 分轨接口。把一段混合音频拆成多条独立音轨，例如人声、音效与配乐，每条音轨单独返回。",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
      "description": "生产环境"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/audios/generations": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Seed Audio 1.5 分轨",
        "description": "> 🚧 **该模型暂未开放，敬请期待**\n\n- 把一段混合音频拆成多条独立音轨（如人声、音效、配乐），在提示词里写清每条音轨保留什么\n- 源音频时长 `2` ~ `360` 秒\n- 异步处理模式，使用返回的任务ID [进行查询](/cn/api-manual/task-management/get-task-detail)，提交后不支持取消\n- 生成的链接有效期为 7 天，请尽快保存\n\n**计费说明：**\n- 按每条音轨的时长累计计费：源音频时长 × 拆出的音轨数，按秒计，不足 1 秒按 1 秒计\n- 提交时按源音频时长 × `3` 条音轨预扣积分（`usage.credits_reserved`），完成后按实际拆出的音轨数结算，多退少补；失败全额退还\n\n**任务结果（`status` 为 `completed` 时）：**\n\n| 字段 | 说明 |\n|---|---|\n| `results` / `result_data[i].audio_url` | 每条音轨的音频链接，两者顺序一致 |\n| `result_data[i].track_type` | 音轨类型，如 `speaker`（人声）、`sfx`（音效与环境声）、`bgm`（背景音乐），也可能出现其他类型 |\n| `result_data[i].description` | 音轨名称，按提示词生成 |\n| `result_data[i].duration` | 音轨时长（秒） |\n| `usage.billed_seconds` / `usage.credits_used` | 计费秒数 / 实际消耗积分 |",
        "operationId": "createSeedAudio15AudioSeparation",
        "tags": [
          "音频生成"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedAudio15Request"
              },
              "examples": {
                "basic": {
                  "summary": "拆成人声、音效、配乐三轨",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "seed-audio-1.5-audio-separation",
                    "prompt": "请将这段音频拆成三条独立音轨：第一轨只保留人物对白，第二轨只保留脚步、门铃和房间环境声，第三轨只保留背景配乐。",
                    "audio_urls": [
                      "https://example.com/mixed.wav"
                    ],
                    "format": "mp3"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "音频生成任务创建成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedAudioResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "unsupported_parameter",
                    "message": "speech_rate is not supported for seed-audio-1.5-audio-separation",
                    "type": "invalid_request_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未认证、Token无效或过期",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "unauthorized",
                    "message": "Invalid or expired token",
                    "type": "authentication_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "配额不足、需要充值",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "insufficient_quota",
                    "message": "Insufficient quota. Please top up your account.",
                    "type": "insufficient_quota"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "无权限访问",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "model_access_denied",
                    "message": "Token does not have access to model: seed-audio-1.5-audio-separation",
                    "type": "invalid_request_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "请求频率超限",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "rate_limit_exceeded",
                    "message": "Too many requests, please try again later",
                    "type": "rate_limit_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "服务器内部错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "internal_error",
                    "message": "Internal server error",
                    "type": "api_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "SeedAudio15Request": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model",
          "prompt",
          "audio_urls"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "模型名称",
            "enum": [
              "seed-audio-1.5-audio-separation"
            ],
            "default": "seed-audio-1.5-audio-separation",
            "example": "seed-audio-1.5-audio-separation"
          },
          "prompt": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "写清要拆成几条音轨、每条保留什么\n\n例如：「请将这段音频拆成三条独立音轨：第一轨只保留人物对白，第二轨只保留脚步、门铃和房间环境声，第三轨只保留背景配乐。」",
            "example": "请将这段音频拆成三条独立音轨：第一轨只保留人物对白，第二轨只保留脚步、门铃和房间环境声，第三轨只保留背景配乐。"
          },
          "audio_urls": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "要拆分的源音频\n\n- 只支持 `1` 段\n- 公网可访问的链接，或 base64（写成 `data:audio/mp3;base64,…` 或 `data:audio/wav;base64,…`）\n\n**音频要求：**\n- 时长 `2` ~ `360` 秒\n- 格式：`wav` / `mp3`\n- 链接方式 ≤ `90 MB`；base64 方式 ≤ `20 MB`，更大的文件请用链接",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 1,
            "example": [
              "https://example.com/mixed.wav"
            ]
          },
          "format": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "输出音频格式\n\n- `wav`（默认）\n- `mp3`\n- `ogg_opus`：只支持 `48000` 采样率\n- `pcm`：不带文件头的原始音频数据（16 位），普通播放器无法直接播放，需要自行处理",
            "enum": [
              "wav",
              "mp3",
              "pcm",
              "ogg_opus"
            ],
            "default": "wav",
            "example": "mp3"
          },
          "sample_rate": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "输出采样率（Hz）\n\n- `wav` / `mp3` / `pcm` 可选下列任一值，默认 `44100`\n- `ogg_opus` 只能为 `48000`，不传时自动使用 `48000`",
            "enum": [
              8000,
              16000,
              24000,
              32000,
              44100,
              48000
            ],
            "default": 44100,
            "example": 24000
          },
          "callback_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "任务完成后的HTTPS回调地址\n\n**回调时机：**\n- 任务完成（completed）、失败（failed）或取消（cancelled）时触发\n- 在计费确认完成后发送\n\n**安全限制：**\n- 仅支持HTTPS协议\n- 禁止回调到内网IP地址（127.0.0.1、10.x.x.x、172.16-31.x.x、192.168.x.x等）\n- URL长度不超过`2048`字符\n\n**回调机制：**\n- 超时时间：`10`秒\n- 失败后最多重试`3`次（会分别在失败的`1`秒/`2`秒/`4`秒后进行重试）\n- 回调响应体格式与任务查询接口返回的格式一致\n- 回调地址若返回2xx状态码视为成功，其他状态码会触发重试",
            "format": "uri",
            "example": "https://your-domain.com/webhooks/audio-completed"
          }
        }
      },
      "SeedAudioResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "created": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "任务创建时间戳",
            "example": 1795776000
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "任务ID",
            "example": "task-unified-1795776000-abcd1234"
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "实际使用的模型名称",
            "example": "seed-audio-1.5-audio-separation"
          },
          "object": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "audio.generation.task"
            ],
            "description": "任务的具体类型"
          },
          "progress": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "任务进度百分比 (0-100)",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 100,
            "example": 0
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "任务状态",
            "enum": [
              "pending",
              "processing",
              "completed",
              "failed"
            ],
            "example": "processing"
          },
          "task_info": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AudioTaskInfo",
            "description": "音频任务详细信息"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "audio"
            ],
            "description": "任务的输出类型",
            "example": "audio"
          },
          "usage": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AudioUsage",
            "description": "使用量和计费信息"
          }
        }
      },
      "AudioTaskInfo": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "can_cancel": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "任务是否可以取消（本模型提交后不支持取消）",
            "example": false
          },
          "estimated_time": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "预估完成时间(秒)",
            "minimum": 0,
            "example": 15
          },
          "audio_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "音频任务类型",
            "example": "audio_separation"
          }
        }
      },
      "AudioUsage": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "使用量信息",
        "properties": {
          "credits_reserved": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "预扣积分数（按源音频时长 × 3 条音轨估算，任务完成后按实际拆出的音轨数结算，多退少补）",
            "minimum": 0,
            "example": 1.2264
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误代码标识符"
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误描述信息"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误类型"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "##所有接口均需要使用Bearer Token进行认证##\n\n**获取 API Key：**\n\n访问 [API Key 管理页面](https://evolink.ai/dashboard/keys) 获取您的 API Key\n\n**使用时在请求头中添加：**\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\n```"
      }
    }
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "音频生成",
      "description": "Seed Audio 1.5 音频生成相关接口"
    }
  ]
}
